OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'revolting'        
OL,4,Avoicemails and emails                  
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for more than two
OL,7,Fyears for sending offensive messages to
OL,8,FReform UK MP Robert Jenrick, the       
OL,9,FIsraeli embassy, the former general    
OL,10,Fsecretary of Labour and a Muslim news  
OL,11,Fsite.                                  
OL,13,FNick Daly, from Oxted in Surrey, sent  
OL,14,Fvoicemails to Jenrick's office in which
OL,15,Fhe made references to the deaths of    
OL,16,Fparliamentarians, as well as emails to 
OL,17,Fthe Israeli embassy which mentioned    
OL,18,Fconcentration camps, Southwark Crown   
OL,19,FCourt heard.                           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
