OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'revolting'        
OL,4,Avoicemails and emails                  
OL,6,FDaly, 30, was jailed for 32 months on  
OL,7,FFriday and given a restraining order   
OL,8,Fhaving pleaded guilty to seven counts  
OL,9,Fof sending malicious communications.   
OL,11,FSentencing Daly, judge Mrs Justice     
OL,12,FWilliams said his messages were        
OL,13,F"permeated with racial and religious   
OL,14,Fhostility".                            
